<div class="parchment-container mx-auto mt-2">
<h1 class="text-center"><%= @campaign.title %></h1>
<% if @already_joined %>
  <p>Thou hast already assumed thy place amongst our bretheren.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>By the gods’ solemn decree, thou art summoned on a fateful journey.
    Fortune and glory await beyond an arduous journey paved with uncertainty, danger, and peril at the hands of your somewhat questionable decisions.
    Thy fate shall entwine thee with wanderers of all walks of life.
    Bringeth they friendship or folly remain shrouded in mystery as you take your first step on a new adventure.
    Wilt thou heed the call?
  </p>
  <%= button_to "Join Campaign", add_player_path(@campaign), method: :post %>
<% end %>
</div>
